==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|set theory}} Of a [[set]], a set that is a [[subset]] of the set but not equal to it.
#: ''{2, 4, 5} is a proper subset of {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}, but {1, 2, 3, 4, 5} is not.''

